WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:15.689
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:15.959 --> 01:16.799
Lacheng Classic.

3
01:16.959 --> 01:17.640
Original Wort: eight.

4
01:17.680 --> 01:18.680
Alcohol: 2.5%.

5
01:18.799 --> 01:19.560
The color is a bit dark.

6
01:19.680 --> 01:20.319
Take a sniff.

7
01:23.480 --> 01:24.959
Beer tasting really comes down to this:

8
01:25.319 --> 01:27.239
Use your eyes to check the clarity,

9
01:27.719 --> 01:29.159
look at the bubbles and the foam,

10
01:29.319 --> 01:30.519
use your nose to smell the aroma,

11
01:30.959 --> 01:32.439
and then taste it with your mouth.

12
01:33.000 --> 01:34.599
Then see if, after swallowing,

13
01:34.599 --> 01:36.040
the aroma still lingers in your nose.

14
01:37.640 --> 01:39.560
Mass-market beer doesn't need fancy flavors,

15
01:39.799 --> 01:40.959
but it must have good mouthfeel

16
01:41.159 --> 01:42.200
and a touch of savoriness.

17
01:43.200 --> 01:44.439
So which kind do you like best?

18
01:45.879 --> 01:46.840
I don't really like drinking,

19
01:47.000 --> 01:47.840
and I can't drink, either.

20
01:48.159 --> 01:49.200
Because of my job,

21
01:49.480 --> 01:50.719
we can't eat spicy

22
01:50.879 --> 01:51.840
or heavily seasoned food.

23
01:52.319 --> 01:54.480
Otherwise, it dulls our taste sensitivity.

24
01:54.799 --> 01:56.400
So for this job,

25
01:56.680 --> 01:58.239
you have to sacrifice a lot.

26
01:58.799 --> 01:59.920
Isn't that just part of it?

27
02:03.239 --> 02:04.000
Xuemei,

28
02:04.760 --> 02:06.840
why did you join the brewery buyout plan?

29
02:07.680 --> 02:08.840
When we all pull together,

30
02:09.120 --> 02:10.560
there's hope for the future.

31
02:11.240 --> 02:12.280
Lapi Brewery is our home,

32
02:12.520 --> 02:13.639
and we all love it.

33
02:14.319 --> 02:15.080
Well said!

34
03:55.360 --> 03:56.240
Anyway,

35
03:57.960 --> 03:59.080
our fate,

36
04:01.120 --> 04:03.240
shouldn't it be in our own hands?

37
04:04.159 --> 04:04.639
Right?

38
04:05.360 --> 04:06.759
Just look around.

39
04:06.960 --> 04:09.120
Who doesn't know people who got laid off?

40
04:10.280 --> 04:12.039
What kind of life are they living?

41
04:14.039 --> 04:16.480
Want to sell tea eggs on the street,

42
04:17.000 --> 04:19.199
scrub backs at a bathhouse,

43
04:20.000 --> 04:21.040
or would you rather

44
04:21.120 --> 04:22.000
stay right here

45
04:22.079 --> 04:23.560
and build something great together?

46
04:25.839 --> 04:26.720
This critical question

47
04:26.720 --> 04:28.319
is staring every one of us in the face.

48
04:28.319 --> 04:29.959
It couldn't be more urgent.

49
04:35.600 --> 04:36.879
I've only got one idea:

50
04:38.360 --> 04:39.680
we pool our money,

51
04:40.279 --> 04:41.879
and buy the factory ourselves.

52
04:45.959 --> 04:46.560
Bottom line:

53
04:48.040 --> 04:48.720
not for anyone else,

54
04:49.720 --> 04:50.879
but for ourselves!

55
04:56.560 --> 04:57.839
Who's in this with me?

56
05:16.240 --> 05:16.879
I'm in!

57
05:18.560 --> 05:19.920
Unity is strength!

58
05:20.680 --> 05:21.720
We must take our destiny

59
05:21.959 --> 05:23.600
into our own hands!

60
05:58.639 --> 05:59.000
Cheers!

61
06:09.600 --> 06:10.240
If my mentor does it,

62
06:10.240 --> 06:10.839
I'll do it too.

63
06:26.720 --> 06:27.279
Let's do it!

64
06:28.120 --> 06:28.759
Drink up!

65
06:34.639 --> 06:35.120
Bottoms up!

66
06:35.720 --> 06:36.560
Count me in.

67
06:39.439 --> 06:39.839
Down it!

68
06:42.759 --> 06:43.560
I'll drink for you!

69
06:46.560 --> 06:47.120
I'll drink too!

70
06:47.800 --> 06:48.439
Drink for me too!

71
06:48.519 --> 06:49.240
I'll drink for you!

72
06:51.959 --> 06:53.720
Come on, finish it off!

73
06:55.680 --> 06:56.399
Give it to me! Give it!

74
06:56.560 --> 06:57.759
Leave some for Workshop Two!

75
06:58.399 --> 06:59.439
Look at you, craving it all day.

76
06:59.720 --> 07:00.199
Here!

77
07:00.199 --> 07:00.959
Holy crap!

78
07:01.079 --> 07:01.720
He drank the whole thing!

79
07:01.720 --> 07:02.319
Gave me a fright!

80
07:02.519 --> 07:03.399
Gather in closer!

81
07:03.920 --> 07:04.600
Come on, get over here!

82
07:04.600 --> 07:05.199
Listen up, folks.

83
07:06.759 --> 07:07.680
Let me make this clear first.

84
07:08.120 --> 07:09.399
I, Cheng Youtian,

85
07:09.639 --> 07:10.439
am a bachelor with nothing to lose.

86
07:10.879 --> 07:11.879
I'm not afraid of retaliation.

87
07:14.120 --> 07:15.360
Whoever wants to join together

88
07:16.120 --> 07:18.360
to buy out and protect our factory,

89
07:19.480 --> 07:20.639
you can sign up now.

90
07:21.240 --> 07:23.160
Come on, sign up with Tu Chunyan!

91
07:33.959 --> 07:37.079
The old Lacheng Brewery,

92
07:37.759 --> 07:41.160
Filled with hope and sunshine.

93
07:41.600 --> 07:44.800
The fragrance of our beer

94
07:45.240 --> 07:48.680
Spreads far and wide.

95
08:42.279 --> 08:42.759
Leshui!

96
08:44.919 --> 08:45.440
Leshui!

97
08:45.759 --> 08:46.480
It's Haipeng!

98
08:47.279 --> 08:47.840
Leshui!

99
08:49.120 --> 08:49.759
It's me, Haipeng!

100
08:57.879 --> 08:58.879
Wh-What's going on?

101
09:02.679 --> 09:03.480
Cao Jun is dead.

102
09:06.000 --> 09:07.399
A black plastic bag over his head,

103
09:07.399 --> 09:08.840
clutching a beer bottle cap in his hand.

104
09:09.480 --> 09:11.159
Exactly the same way Ma Guowen died.

105
09:11.320 --> 09:12.320
When?

106
09:12.399 --> 09:13.279
No idea.

107
09:14.720 --> 09:16.240
Tieping found him early this morning.

108
09:17.440 --> 09:19.120
Anyway, everyone out there is in a panic.

109
09:19.639 --> 09:22.399
No one knows who's next.

110
09:23.519 --> 09:25.039
I just saw him earlier today.

111
09:25.559 --> 09:26.120
You saw him?

112
09:26.519 --> 09:27.159
In the courtyard.

113
09:27.639 --> 09:28.080
Listen to me.

114
09:28.080 --> 09:29.600
Don't you dare go around saying that.

115
09:30.799 --> 09:31.600
The neighbor across the hall

116
09:31.639 --> 09:33.240
was already hauled in by the cops for questioning.

117
09:33.559 --> 09:34.879
So don't you get dragged into this.

118
09:34.879 --> 09:35.559
Got it?

119
09:36.960 --> 09:38.159
That's not up to me.

120
09:47.720 --> 09:48.320
Leshui,

121
09:50.000 --> 09:51.320
you should really leave Lacheng.

122
09:54.440 --> 09:55.639
But the house hasn't sold yet.

123
09:55.879 --> 09:57.600
Come on, look what's happening now.

124
09:57.840 --> 09:59.360
Who has the mind to buy a house now?

125
09:59.559 --> 10:00.279
Exactly.

126
10:00.440 --> 10:01.480
The buyers looking at the place lately

127
10:01.480 --> 10:02.759
are using the murders to lower the price.

128
10:02.840 --> 10:04.279
So if the price isn't right,

129
10:04.320 --> 10:05.679
don't rush to sell it off.

130
10:06.600 --> 10:07.440
If you need money urgently,

131
10:07.440 --> 10:07.919
you can ask me.

132
10:07.919 --> 10:08.519
No, no, no need.

133
10:08.960 --> 10:10.000
What you lent me before,

134
10:10.000 --> 10:10.879
I haven't even paid back yet.

135
10:11.200 --> 10:12.000
Once things get better,

136
10:12.000 --> 10:12.720
I'll pay you back.

137
10:13.039 --> 10:14.320
Can we drop this for now?

138
10:14.639 --> 10:16.200
Safety is what matters most right now.

139
10:18.000 --> 10:18.720
Don't you think

140
10:19.559 --> 10:21.799
one person killed Ma Guowen and Cao Jun?

141
10:22.000 --> 10:22.960
Both had black plastic bags,

142
10:23.519 --> 10:24.879
and both had a bottle cap.

143
10:27.320 --> 10:27.960
Not necessarily.

144
10:29.679 --> 10:31.480
I saw how Ma Guowen ended up.

145
10:32.600 --> 10:33.639
Kneeling on the train tracks,

146
10:33.840 --> 10:34.600
hunched over,

147
10:35.240 --> 10:35.919
put on public display.

148
10:36.080 --> 10:37.320
It was a way of atoning for sin.

149
10:37.759 --> 10:38.919
It means the killer

150
10:39.200 --> 10:40.639
held a massive grudge against him.

151
10:40.879 --> 10:42.559
But who could have a grudge against Cao Jun?

152
10:46.360 --> 10:46.879
Exactly.

153
10:49.799 --> 10:51.399
Who could hold a grudge against Cao Jun?

154
10:56.279 --> 10:58.000
I think that cop is suspicious.

155
11:00.720 --> 11:01.519
A cop?

156
11:03.639 --> 11:05.600
How did you get tangled up with a cop?

157
11:06.679 --> 11:07.120
Look,

158
11:07.960 --> 11:09.039
Leshui, listen to me.

159
11:09.879 --> 11:10.559
Just listen to me.

160
11:10.879 --> 11:11.720
Leave here right away.

161
11:12.080 --> 11:13.399
Weren't you going to Yunnan to do business?

162
11:13.399 --> 11:14.240
Just go, right now.

163
11:14.960 --> 11:15.960
If you're short on cash, come to me.

164
11:15.960 --> 11:16.879
J-Just consider it a loan.

165
11:17.320 --> 11:18.200
I used to think

166
11:18.200 --> 11:19.799
I was done with Lapi Brewery.

167
11:20.159 --> 11:21.080
But over the past few days,

168
11:21.440 --> 11:22.840
I watched that discarded footage again.

169
11:24.960 --> 11:26.600
I want to take all this scrap footage

170
11:26.600 --> 11:28.000
and re-edit it into a new film.

171
11:29.159 --> 11:32.000
This scrap footage looks so precious now.

172
11:32.159 --> 11:34.000
I wouldn't have it without your help.

173
11:34.360 --> 11:35.519
If you're willing,

174
11:35.639 --> 11:37.360
we could make "The New Malt Kingdom."

175
11:38.360 --> 11:39.399
Didn't you say back then

176
11:39.399 --> 11:41.200
that this was for our kids and grandkids?

177
11:41.600 --> 11:43.279
Now you're about to be a father.

178
11:43.639 --> 11:44.919
Don't you want your kid to see

179
11:44.919 --> 11:46.200
how great their dad was back in the day?

180
11:49.440 --> 11:50.639
What greatness?

181
11:52.440 --> 11:54.120
It's been so many years.

182
11:54.559 --> 11:56.120
Who cares about that anymore?

183
11:56.440 --> 11:58.159
No one will watch no matter how you edit.

184
11:59.879 --> 12:01.679
Leshui, let's be realistic.

185
12:02.960 --> 12:03.960
Take Cao Jun.

186
12:05.919 --> 12:07.000
Such an honest man,

187
12:07.080 --> 12:07.960
and even he was murdered.

188
12:09.519 --> 12:10.200
Let me tell you,

189
12:11.960 --> 12:12.799
I really feel like

190
12:14.080 --> 12:14.919
this killer

191
12:15.120 --> 12:16.080
is very likely

192
12:16.279 --> 12:17.639
coming after the old-timers

193
12:17.639 --> 12:18.679
who sold off the factory back then.

194
12:20.240 --> 12:22.000
So what happened in the past, you really

195
12:22.559 --> 12:23.240
can't bring it up anymore.

196
12:30.879 --> 12:31.279
And another thing,

197
12:32.279 --> 12:33.360
those old materials of yours,

198
12:34.279 --> 12:36.000
I don't think they're safe here.

199
12:37.399 --> 12:39.080
I happen to have a big safe at my place.

200
12:39.840 --> 12:40.639
Let me take them over for you.

201
12:40.840 --> 12:41.159
Alright?

202
12:41.159 --> 12:41.919
No need, no need.

203
12:42.039 --> 12:42.960
It's fine, it's fine.

204
12:42.960 --> 12:43.679
Just hurry up and go home.

205
12:43.679 --> 12:44.720
No, let me take them. Look after Lili.

206
12:45.039 --> 12:46.200
Just take good care of Lili, okay?

207
12:46.559 --> 12:47.440
You're really something.

208
12:47.759 --> 12:49.240
Once you make up your mind,

209
12:49.240 --> 12:50.360
nothing can change it.

210
12:50.679 --> 12:51.080
Right.

211
12:51.080 --> 12:52.440
Haven't I always been like this?

212
12:52.840 --> 12:53.360
Just hurry up and head back.

213
12:53.360 --> 12:53.720
No, no, no.

214
12:53.759 --> 12:54.399
I'm not finished yet.

215
12:55.960 --> 12:56.840
Let me warn you.

216
12:57.679 --> 12:58.639
Those old-timers from back then,

217
12:58.919 --> 12:59.559
stay away from them.

218
12:59.840 --> 13:00.360
Man,

219
13:00.360 --> 13:01.360
who the good guys are

220
13:01.360 --> 13:01.840
and who the enemies are,

221
13:01.840 --> 13:02.639
you really can't tell.

222
13:02.759 --> 13:04.200
Why are you nagging so much?

223
13:04.200 --> 13:04.879
Got it, got it.

224
13:04.879 --> 13:05.720
Hurry up and head back.

225
13:06.159 --> 13:06.919
Go on, get moving.

226
13:07.240 --> 13:07.799
I'm leaving then.

227
13:07.879 --> 13:08.480
Go ahead, go on.

228
13:09.000 --> 13:10.039
You stay safe, okay?

229
13:13.120 --> 13:13.480
By the way,

230
13:14.120 --> 13:14.840
you've got to change this lock.

231
13:14.879 --> 13:15.720
Got it? - Yeah, yeah.

232
13:15.720 --> 13:16.120
It's too old.

233
13:16.120 --> 13:16.519
Alright, alright, alright.

234
13:16.559 --> 13:17.000
I know, I know.

235
13:17.000 --> 13:18.600
Hurry home. - You need a new one.

236
13:38.240 --> 13:38.759
Hey, Sis.

237
13:39.200 --> 13:40.720
A buddy of mine just opened a pub.

238
13:40.720 --> 13:41.480
How about dropping by?

239
13:41.960 --> 13:43.039
Your buddy opened it,

240
13:43.039 --> 13:44.360
not you.

241
13:46.639 --> 13:48.279
Once you open your own place,

242
13:48.639 --> 13:49.600
I'll think about it.

243
13:50.919 --> 13:51.519
That's why they say

244
13:51.519 --> 13:53.320
nothing gets past your sharp eyes.

245
13:53.600 --> 13:54.360
It's actually mine.

246
13:55.039 --> 13:55.639
So, what do you say, Sis?

247
13:55.639 --> 13:56.840
Come check it out

248
13:57.159 --> 13:57.879
and give us some feedback?

249
13:58.240 --> 13:59.679
Send me the address, then.

250
14:00.480 --> 14:01.320
All right!

251
14:01.559 --> 14:02.120
Thanks, Sis!

252
14:02.159 --> 14:02.960
We'll be waiting for you!

253
14:03.200 --> 14:04.320
I'll send you the location now.

254
14:11.879 --> 14:12.600
Sis,

255
14:13.080 --> 14:13.960
thanks so much for coming.

256
14:14.200 --> 14:15.240
How do you like my place?

257
14:16.720 --> 14:17.159
Not bad.

258
14:17.679 --> 14:19.480
I prepared some great steak just for you,

259
14:19.519 --> 14:20.480
plus red wine,

260
14:20.519 --> 14:21.720
beer, liquor, and whiskey.

261
14:21.960 --> 14:22.519
Take your pick.

262
14:22.559 --> 14:23.879
No need. Let's get down to business.

263
14:24.759 --> 14:25.879
Actually, the reason I invited you over

264
14:26.080 --> 14:27.240
was to talk business, too.

265
14:27.279 --> 14:27.960
Then right this way, please.

266
14:28.879 --> 14:29.279
Sis,

267
14:29.759 --> 14:30.679
remember how you asked me

268
14:30.679 --> 14:32.080
to look into Gao Xuelin?

269
14:32.320 --> 14:32.960
I found something.

270
14:33.360 --> 14:34.440
He's a detective.

271
14:34.559 --> 14:35.200
A detective.

272
14:35.679 --> 14:36.679
And he's right here in Lacheng.

273
14:37.000 --> 14:38.600
Then he must be really busy right now.

274
14:38.919 --> 14:40.960
With the serial murders at Lapi Brewery.

275
14:41.279 --> 14:43.120
Your previous film, Malt Kingdom,

276
14:43.120 --> 14:44.159
was about Lapi Brewery too.

277
14:44.519 --> 14:46.720
The workers lost the buyout to Ma Guowen.

278
14:47.279 --> 14:48.279
Over a decade later,

279
14:48.360 --> 14:49.559
the moment you returned to Lacheng,

280
14:49.919 --> 14:51.559
Ma Guowen invited you to shoot a film.

281
14:52.159 --> 14:53.519
Yet the very next day when shooting began,

282
14:54.279 --> 14:56.360
you filmed the scene of Ma Guowen's death.

283
14:57.080 --> 14:59.120
With your sharp instincts,

284
14:59.399 --> 15:01.559
you must've realized the past and present

285
15:01.559 --> 15:02.480
are bound to be connected.

286
15:02.879 --> 15:04.480
We could definitely make a major,

287
15:04.759 --> 15:06.519
hard-hitting investigative piece.

288
15:08.240 --> 15:10.159
And didn't another person die recently?

289
15:10.159 --> 15:12.720
A former forklift driver at Lapi Brewery.

290
15:13.759 --> 15:15.159
Judging by his age,

291
15:15.440 --> 15:17.799
he was probably in that buyout too.

292
15:19.440 --> 15:21.120
You sure know a lot,

293
15:21.120 --> 15:21.919
Li Mingyang.

294
15:22.519 --> 15:23.840
Then let me tell you a secret.

295
15:25.879 --> 15:27.120
In the Ma Guowen case,

296
15:27.360 --> 15:29.840
one of the detectives on the task force

297
15:34.519 --> 15:35.480
is Gao Xuelin.

298
15:38.120 --> 15:40.879
Ever since he questioned me at the station,

299
15:41.080 --> 15:42.600
I found him a bit strange.

300
15:43.559 --> 15:44.679
Later, when he came to my place,

301
15:45.480 --> 15:47.919
he clearly saw my hidden camera,

302
15:48.360 --> 15:49.559
yet pretended not to notice,

303
15:50.159 --> 15:50.879
and didn't report it.

304
15:51.639 --> 15:52.360
Then,

305
15:53.279 --> 15:55.080
he asked to see my unused footage.

306
15:55.960 --> 15:57.120
After I turned him down,

307
15:57.240 --> 15:58.120
he still didn't give up

308
15:58.440 --> 15:59.879
and kept digging.

309
16:01.120 --> 16:02.799
All these moves of his

310
16:03.600 --> 16:05.000
point to a single target:

311
16:05.440 --> 16:06.440
Liu Xuemei.

312
16:06.879 --> 16:08.840
The Beer Taster who froze to death in '99.

313
16:09.200 --> 16:09.799
He wants to know

314
16:09.799 --> 16:11.840
what happened the day Liu Xuemei died.

315
16:12.679 --> 16:16.039
A detective on the Ma Guowen case

316
16:16.559 --> 16:18.120
focusing so much on someone unrelated,

317
16:18.720 --> 16:20.720
who was ruled over a decade ago

318
16:21.440 --> 16:24.840
to have died a natural death—Liu Xuemei.

319
16:25.559 --> 16:27.039
Isn't that strange?

320
16:27.279 --> 16:28.720
Very strange.

321
16:29.200 --> 16:30.679
What's even stranger

322
16:31.200 --> 16:32.039
is that he seems to do all this

323
16:32.039 --> 16:33.399
behind his superiors' backs.

324
16:36.360 --> 16:37.399
I think

325
16:38.159 --> 16:40.000
he's using his position

326
16:40.600 --> 16:42.080
to do something else.

327
16:42.679 --> 16:44.240
Is he trying to uncover something,

328
16:44.919 --> 16:46.320
or cover something up?

329
16:47.200 --> 16:48.240
I think

330
16:48.519 --> 16:50.159
there's definitely something wrong with him.

331
16:53.720 --> 16:54.879
Then let's first

332
16:54.879 --> 16:56.399
dig into his background,

333
16:56.799 --> 16:58.279
and find out what his connection

334
16:58.279 --> 16:59.240
to Liu Xuemei really is.

335
17:00.279 --> 17:02.519
The police are busy solving cases now.

336
17:02.519 --> 17:03.320
Let's not get in their way.

337
17:04.559 --> 17:06.720
Whatever personal info you find on Gao,

338
17:07.200 --> 17:08.920
don't leak it under any circumstances.

339
17:10.720 --> 17:12.480
Don't act on your own.

340
17:13.000 --> 17:13.680
Understood.

341
17:18.839 --> 17:20.920
This is the card from your camera.

342
17:21.240 --> 17:22.359
We've already looked through it.

343
17:22.440 --> 17:23.200
Nothing wrong with it.

344
17:23.200 --> 17:23.960
You can take it back.

345
17:25.480 --> 17:26.960
Though, when you have time,

346
17:27.119 --> 17:29.680
can I see your old unused footage?

347
17:31.279 --> 17:31.799
Sure.

348
17:32.640 --> 17:33.799
Come by whenever you're free.

349
17:34.680 --> 17:35.599
Just not Gao Xuelin.

350
17:38.720 --> 17:40.119
That kid is still young.

351
17:40.759 --> 17:41.759
He's a bit too blunt.

352
17:43.079 --> 17:43.880
Where's he from?

353
17:44.200 --> 17:44.960
Qingzhou.

354
17:46.000 --> 17:47.680
Doesn't he have any relatives

355
17:47.680 --> 17:49.519
or family living in Lacheng?

356
17:49.839 --> 17:50.359
Why?

357
17:50.759 --> 17:52.119
Why the sudden interest in him?

358
17:52.720 --> 17:53.400
Just curious.

359
17:54.640 --> 17:56.240
Curiosity killed the cat, you know.

360
17:57.000 --> 17:58.240
Aren't we old classmates?

361
17:58.279 --> 17:59.480
Can't old classmates tell the truth?

362
17:59.480 --> 18:00.440
Old classmates, right.

363
18:00.960 --> 18:02.119
Do you even know my name?

364
18:03.000 --> 18:03.640
Sun Jinfu.

365
18:05.400 --> 18:05.880
Right.

366
18:05.880 --> 18:07.039
My name is Sun Jinfu.

367
18:09.720 --> 18:11.799
Gao Xuelin isn't a local,

368
18:12.119 --> 18:13.799
and has no family here.

369
18:14.559 --> 18:16.839
Yet he asked about Liu Xuemei right away.

370
18:17.519 --> 18:19.039
When that happened to Liu Xuemei,

371
18:19.119 --> 18:20.200
he must've been very young.

372
18:20.880 --> 18:22.720
So why does he know so much

373
18:22.720 --> 18:23.759
about the old Lapi Brewery?

374
18:29.599 --> 18:31.200
I've noted down everything you reported.

375
18:35.079 --> 18:36.559
We have a vetting department here.

376
18:36.799 --> 18:37.599
Don't worry.

377
18:38.680 --> 18:40.599
You might not want to hear this,

378
18:41.480 --> 18:43.319
but you should worry more about yourself.

379
18:44.759 --> 18:45.960
Did you sell that house?

380
18:46.720 --> 18:47.599
Found a buyer yet?

381
18:51.599 --> 18:52.319
As a detective,

382
18:52.319 --> 18:53.519
having done this for so many years,

383
18:53.720 --> 18:54.279
let me tell you,

384
18:54.279 --> 18:56.039
all the weird people and bizarre things...

385
18:56.039 --> 18:56.640
there's plenty out there.

386
18:57.119 --> 18:58.039
And working as a journalist,

387
18:58.240 --> 18:59.279
you must've seen quite a lot too.

388
19:00.160 --> 19:02.319
But I think a detective's mindset

389
19:02.519 --> 19:04.039
and a journalist's mindset...

390
19:04.359 --> 19:05.000
are different.

391
19:05.720 --> 19:06.920
Think about it.

392
19:07.720 --> 19:08.839
For a cop,

393
19:09.079 --> 19:10.680
nothing surprises them.

394
19:11.279 --> 19:12.039
As for journalists,

395
19:12.599 --> 19:14.359
the weirder, the better.

396
19:15.440 --> 19:16.519
They dread the ordinary.

397
19:17.960 --> 19:18.640
Right?

398
19:20.039 --> 19:20.839
When you've seen too much,

399
19:21.759 --> 19:23.000
what's normal feels abnormal,

400
19:23.559 --> 19:25.000
and what's abnormal feels normal.

401
19:26.960 --> 19:27.880
Thank you, Officer Han.

402
19:28.240 --> 19:28.839
Goodbye.

403
19:31.000 --> 19:31.599
Take care.

404
19:33.920 --> 19:36.160
Why did she call you Sun Jinfu?

405
19:37.240 --> 19:37.839
My stage name.

406
19:39.039 --> 19:39.839
Stage name?

407
20:00.640 --> 20:01.400
Liu Tieping!

408
20:02.720 --> 20:03.440
Cao Jun is dead.

409
20:04.200 --> 20:05.079
Tieping found him.

410
20:10.920 --> 20:11.759
Liu Tieping!

411
20:14.480 --> 20:15.079
Liu Tieping!

412
20:15.119 --> 20:16.240
It's me, Shen Leshui!

413
20:16.519 --> 20:17.319
Remember me?

414
20:23.559 --> 20:24.359
Liu Tieping!

415
20:26.000 --> 20:26.680
Liu Tieping!

416
20:28.240 --> 20:28.720
Driver!

417
20:29.160 --> 20:30.720
Catch up to that guy ahead!

418
20:31.119 --> 20:32.240
I'll pay you double!

419
20:32.960 --> 20:33.480
Deal.

420
20:33.920 --> 20:34.720
Pay upfront.

421
20:37.720 --> 20:38.599
Liu Tieping!

422
20:39.640 --> 20:40.319
Driver, here's the money!

423
20:46.759 --> 20:48.240
Liu Tieping, stop running!

424
20:49.920 --> 20:50.880
Liu Tieping!

425
20:51.920 --> 20:53.680
Liu Tieping, stop running!

426
21:00.480 --> 21:01.440
Liu Tieping!

427
21:11.000 --> 21:11.799
Oh, come on...

428
21:13.400 --> 21:14.160
Liu Tieping!

429
21:17.279 --> 21:18.680
Why are you running?

430
21:19.960 --> 21:20.720
You didn't do anything wrong!

431
21:20.720 --> 21:21.400
Why run?

432
21:22.400 --> 21:23.359
Because you're chasing me!

433
21:24.039 --> 21:24.480
If you didn't run,

434
21:24.480 --> 21:25.480
why would I chase you?

435
21:25.920 --> 21:26.200
No!

436
21:26.440 --> 21:27.880
I ran because you were chasing me!

437
21:28.559 --> 21:29.960
Why would I chase you if you didn't run?

438
21:37.160 --> 21:38.640
You found Cao Jun this morning, right?

439
21:39.480 --> 21:40.319
Go ask the cops!

440
21:40.839 --> 21:41.640
Who do you think

441
21:42.200 --> 21:43.279
killed Cao Jun?

442
21:44.759 --> 21:45.240
Hey,

443
21:45.359 --> 21:46.559
I'm not a cop!

444
21:48.279 --> 21:49.519
Cao Jun and Ma Guowen...

445
21:49.960 --> 21:51.119
Who else were they tied up with?

446
21:51.920 --> 21:52.559
Ask the cops!

447
21:53.880 --> 21:54.720
One last question.

448
21:55.079 --> 21:55.920
Just one last question.

449
21:56.720 --> 21:58.680
Liu Xuemei had a kid.

450
21:59.480 --> 22:00.240
How old back then?

451
22:02.119 --> 22:03.039
Why are you asking about that?

452
22:04.880 --> 22:07.160
Since I can't leave Lacheng right now,

453
22:07.880 --> 22:09.440
I've been going through discarded footage.

454
22:10.279 --> 22:11.440
I saw Sister Xuemei.

455
22:13.920 --> 22:14.720
Seven or eight, I guess.

456
22:16.880 --> 22:18.400
Do you know who she was close to

457
22:18.839 --> 22:20.079
back in those days?

458
22:20.200 --> 22:21.279
Who were her closest friends?

459
22:22.640 --> 22:23.160
I don't know.

460
22:43.319 --> 22:43.799
Need something?

461
22:45.799 --> 22:46.519
"Need something?"

462
22:47.400 --> 22:48.359
You're asking me?

463
22:50.400 --> 22:51.519
You're hilarious.

464
22:52.400 --> 22:54.400
In a Lacheng putting on an act contest,

465
22:54.400 --> 22:55.400
you'd definitely take first prize.

466
22:57.160 --> 22:58.799
I don't get what you're trying to say.

467
23:03.400 --> 23:03.880
Let's go to your room.

468
23:04.160 --> 23:04.680
Too chaotic out here.

469
23:08.240 --> 23:09.480
What do you want, anyway?

470
23:10.839 --> 23:12.119
Come to the police station with me.

471
23:12.920 --> 23:13.880
In front of me,

472
23:14.039 --> 23:15.279
tell the police clearly

473
23:15.680 --> 23:16.839
that I'm not a suspect.

474
23:18.200 --> 23:19.279
Why would you be a suspect?

475
23:21.640 --> 23:23.279
Didn't you report me?

476
23:24.160 --> 23:25.440
Stop playing dumb.

477
23:26.200 --> 23:27.319
I reported you?

478
23:27.880 --> 23:28.400
Yeah.

479
23:28.759 --> 23:29.720
You told the police.

480
23:30.480 --> 23:32.440
You said I was with Cao Jun last night.

481
23:32.640 --> 23:33.680
Now Cao Jun is dead,

482
23:33.920 --> 23:34.720
and they suspect me.

483
23:35.359 --> 23:35.920
What happened to you?

484
23:36.000 --> 23:37.039
Wasn't it you who reported me?

485
23:37.240 --> 23:38.559
They hauled me in and grilled me.

486
23:39.359 --> 23:40.279
Well, let me tell you,

487
23:40.599 --> 23:41.319
I didn't report you.

488
23:42.559 --> 23:44.000
Not a word out of your mouth is true.

489
23:46.839 --> 23:47.640
I know.

490
23:48.319 --> 23:49.480
None of you like me.

491
23:51.480 --> 23:52.720
Just because "Malt Kingdom"

492
23:52.799 --> 23:54.039
didn't turn out the way you wanted,

493
23:56.119 --> 23:57.319
you think I'm a traitor

494
23:58.240 --> 23:59.480
who sold out to Ma Guowen.

495
24:01.279 --> 24:02.359
Well, let me tell you,

496
24:03.680 --> 24:04.359
I'm sick of it too.

497
24:07.039 --> 24:08.359
I thought it was easy money,

498
24:08.720 --> 24:10.119
right when I needed cash most,

499
24:10.119 --> 24:11.480
a chance to make a quick buck came along.

500
24:11.599 --> 24:12.200
And what happened?

501
24:12.319 --> 24:13.559
Stuck here and can't go back to Beijing.

502
24:15.079 --> 24:16.279
You're short on cash too?

503
24:16.759 --> 24:18.519
Guess you're not doing well in Beijing.

504
24:19.680 --> 24:20.720
Do you own a place in Beijing?

505
24:22.839 --> 24:23.559
Haven't bought a car either, right?

506
24:25.960 --> 24:27.400
So you're just one of those legendary

507
24:27.640 --> 24:28.480
Beijing drifters?

508
24:28.880 --> 24:29.359
Yeah.

509
24:30.640 --> 24:31.599
I was just a contract worker.

510
24:32.880 --> 24:34.039
When they downsized,

511
24:34.359 --> 24:35.160
people like me were the ones cut.

512
24:36.920 --> 24:38.240
You got laid off?

513
24:39.079 --> 24:39.599
Serves you right.

514
24:41.559 --> 24:43.839
I thought the world couldn't hold you.

515
24:45.720 --> 24:46.880
Think about it carefully.

516
24:48.480 --> 24:49.799
The two people who died

517
24:50.240 --> 24:51.640
were both from the old Lapi Brewery.

518
24:52.799 --> 24:54.440
And Liu Xuemei from over a decade ago.

519
24:55.079 --> 24:56.079
We knew all of them.

520
24:57.400 --> 24:58.000
So what?

521
24:58.799 --> 25:00.240
Wanna bury the three of them together?

522
25:02.559 --> 25:03.799
I want to know

523
25:04.279 --> 25:05.279
how these cases

524
25:05.400 --> 25:06.599
are connected.

525
25:07.759 --> 25:09.200
I want to know who the killer is.

526
25:09.599 --> 25:10.680
Will he stop?

527
25:10.759 --> 25:12.000
Will anyone else die?

528
25:13.839 --> 25:15.319
Only by finding the killer soon

529
25:16.160 --> 25:18.039
can we prevent more murders.

530
25:19.279 --> 25:20.920
You must be out of your mind.

531
25:21.720 --> 25:23.559
Why get tangled up in murder cases?

532
25:24.079 --> 25:25.000
Let me tell you,

533
25:25.400 --> 25:26.799
I'm staying out of this.

534
25:30.200 --> 25:31.359
I was honest with you,

535
25:31.640 --> 25:32.720
so be honest with me.

536
25:33.000 --> 25:34.240
Did you see Cao Jun yesterday?

537
25:34.920 --> 25:35.640
What did he say?

538
25:36.160 --> 25:37.440
Who do you think you are, a cop?

539
25:38.079 --> 25:39.039
Interrogating me?

540
25:39.920 --> 25:41.000
Why should I tell you anything?

541
25:41.920 --> 25:43.039
I'll only say this to the police.

542
25:43.039 --> 25:44.039
What business is it of yours?

543
25:52.039 --> 25:52.599
Shen Leshui.

544
25:53.880 --> 25:54.359
How about

545
25:54.799 --> 25:56.400
we just get out of this dump?

546
25:57.279 --> 25:58.440
It's terrifying.

547
25:59.400 --> 26:00.880
People are dying every few days.

548
26:02.680 --> 26:04.799
Neither of us can leave right now.

549
26:05.400 --> 26:06.880
The one who killed Ma Guowen and Cao Jun...

550
26:06.880 --> 26:07.960
is it the same person,

551
26:07.960 --> 26:08.960
or someone else?

552
26:08.960 --> 26:09.759
What's the motive?

553
26:09.759 --> 26:10.519
If we don't figure it out,

554
26:10.519 --> 26:12.000
none of us can live in peace.

555
26:32.519 --> 26:33.440
You just said

556
26:33.839 --> 26:34.720
that Ma Guowen

557
26:35.440 --> 26:36.160
and Cao Jun

558
26:38.400 --> 26:39.599
are both from the old Lapi Brewery.

559
26:41.559 --> 26:42.240
Do you think

560
26:43.039 --> 26:45.599
the two of them were involved

561
26:46.200 --> 26:47.400
in Liu Xuemei's death back then?

562
26:50.519 --> 26:51.440
Over the years,

563
26:51.880 --> 26:53.640
you've stayed close to the old-timers.

564
26:54.599 --> 26:55.920
Didn't you notice anything off?

565
27:05.119 --> 27:06.480
Close? Hardly.

566
27:08.000 --> 27:09.319
Nobody has time for anyone else.

567
27:09.920 --> 27:10.880
Everyone's busy with their own lives.

568
27:17.000 --> 27:18.480
I went to see Cao Jun last night

569
27:20.359 --> 27:21.519
just to have a chat with him

570
27:23.079 --> 27:24.240
about Old Qian.

571
27:40.440 --> 27:42.359
If you could perform here one day,

572
27:42.839 --> 27:43.960
how awesome would that be?

573
27:44.200 --> 27:45.359
You'd be a real pop star.

574
27:46.039 --> 27:46.960
Go up there and blow them away!

575
27:47.319 --> 27:47.920
Yan!

576
27:48.880 --> 27:49.799
Long time no see! Long time no see!

577
27:49.799 --> 27:50.599
Thanks! Thank you!

578
27:51.119 --> 27:52.400
Mr. Qian, Mr. Qian.

579
27:52.519 --> 27:53.079
Come on over.

580
27:53.319 --> 27:53.759
Mr. Qian.

581
27:53.920 --> 27:54.720
Let me introduce him.

582
27:54.759 --> 27:55.960
This is Qian, Qian Yichuan.

583
27:56.000 --> 27:56.319
That's right.

584
27:56.319 --> 27:56.880
Hello, hello.

585
27:56.920 --> 27:57.640
Yu, hello, hello!

586
27:57.839 --> 27:58.559
Nice to meet you.

587
27:58.640 --> 27:58.960
Hello.

588
27:59.160 --> 28:00.519
Look at you, Yan, still so gorgeous!

589
28:02.279 --> 28:02.920
Oh, stop it.

590
28:02.920 --> 28:03.880
I'm getting old.

591
28:05.359 --> 28:06.480
Qian here is super talented.

592
28:06.759 --> 28:08.079
So... what kind of artist are you?

593
28:08.400 --> 28:10.279
I'm... I'm an accountant at our factory.

594
28:10.920 --> 28:11.440
What?

595
28:12.079 --> 28:13.160
With a bachelor's degree.

596
28:13.799 --> 28:15.160
I like to sing a bit in my spare time.

597
28:15.400 --> 28:16.160
Chunyan told me

598
28:16.160 --> 28:18.680
that you're hiring singers here.

599
28:20.039 --> 28:22.359
Your stage looks really awesome.

600
28:22.759 --> 28:24.000
Of course. It's the best in town.

601
28:24.119 --> 28:24.440
Right.

602
28:24.480 --> 28:26.160
I was hoping to use your stage

603
28:26.240 --> 28:27.359
to put my remaining energy to use,

604
28:27.599 --> 28:28.559
and show what I've got.

605
28:29.519 --> 28:30.680
Buddy, are you fifty?

606
28:30.839 --> 28:31.640
Me? No, not yet.

607
28:33.079 --> 28:33.920
I'm 47.

608
28:34.079 --> 28:34.680
Born in the year of the Rooster.

609
28:34.799 --> 28:35.559
Yu,

610
28:36.000 --> 28:37.640
Qian sings with so much passion.

611
28:37.640 --> 28:38.440
He's really good!

612
28:38.839 --> 28:39.720
Your voice is decent?

613
28:40.039 --> 28:40.640
Not bad.

614
28:41.400 --> 28:43.039
I wanted to enter the Central Conservatory.

615
28:43.039 --> 28:43.839
My family thought it was too far,

616
28:43.839 --> 28:44.519
so they didn't let me go.

617
28:45.200 --> 28:45.960
When I sing,

618
28:45.960 --> 28:47.279
I usually project from the diaphragm.

619
28:48.039 --> 28:49.319
Look at the kids nowadays.

620
28:49.359 --> 28:51.440
They don't know where the diaphragm is.

621
28:51.640 --> 28:53.519
You tighten your lower abdomen,

622
28:53.559 --> 28:54.440
push the breath up,

623
28:54.799 --> 28:55.519
and project your voice out.

624
28:55.839 --> 28:57.039
Once I stand up on that stage,

625
28:57.440 --> 28:58.160
even without a mic,

626
28:58.160 --> 28:59.000
sitting right where you are,

627
28:59.000 --> 28:59.440
it'll sound crystal clear!

628
29:00.079 --> 29:01.200
Yu, let me tell you,

629
29:01.559 --> 29:02.799
Qian is truly talented.

630
29:03.039 --> 29:04.680
The anthem of our old Lapi Brewery?

631
29:04.799 --> 29:05.559
He wrote it.

632
29:05.599 --> 29:06.240
I wrote the lyrics.

633
29:07.559 --> 29:08.680
Then go ahead...

634
29:08.759 --> 29:09.880
sing a few lines for us.

635
29:10.599 --> 29:11.160
Give us a taste.

636
29:11.240 --> 29:12.160
Wh-What should I sing?

637
29:12.480 --> 29:13.519
Sing the factory anthem!

638
29:15.039 --> 29:15.440
Is that alright?

639
29:15.599 --> 29:15.839
Go for it.

640
29:15.880 --> 29:16.319
Come on, let's hear it!

641
29:16.319 --> 29:16.720
Give him a hand!

642
29:16.720 --> 29:17.240
Come on, come on.

643
29:18.799 --> 29:19.559
Put your glasses on.

644
29:19.599 --> 29:20.200
Come on, over here.

645
29:20.559 --> 29:21.079
Step right up.

646
29:22.119 --> 29:22.799
Make way, everyone.

647
29:24.519 --> 29:24.839
Yu.

648
29:24.839 --> 29:25.519
Come on, Yan, what are you doing...

649
29:25.599 --> 29:26.440
Put it behind, behind, behind.

650
29:26.559 --> 29:26.880
Okay.

651
29:26.920 --> 29:27.319
Between you and me,

652
29:27.319 --> 29:28.559
why are you doing this?

653
29:28.559 --> 29:29.200
Just a small token.

654
29:29.240 --> 29:30.000
Come on, take it, take it.

655
29:30.000 --> 29:30.279
You really shouldn't have...

656
29:30.559 --> 29:32.359
Could you play the backing track for me?

657
29:32.519 --> 29:33.519
How professional!

658
29:33.839 --> 29:35.000
I'll find it. The sound system is great.

659
29:35.119 --> 29:35.759
It sure is.

660
29:35.880 --> 29:36.920
I've been dying to try it out.

661
29:40.720 --> 29:41.880
You've got this, Qian!

662
29:47.119 --> 29:48.400
Three, two, one

663
29:48.480 --> 29:48.880
Sing!

664
29:49.119 --> 29:52.759
Old Lacheng Brewery

665
29:52.880 --> 29:56.480
Full of hope and sunshine

666
29:56.759 --> 29:59.920
The aroma of our beer

667
30:00.119 --> 30:03.759
Drifts far and wide

668
30:08.000 --> 30:10.279
Old Lacheng Brewery

669
30:10.400 --> 30:11.400
Brewery

670
30:11.880 --> 30:14.119
Radiant and glorious, shining bright

671
30:14.240 --> 30:15.279
Shining bright!

672
30:44.680 --> 30:45.240
Good!

673
30:48.640 --> 30:49.160
Nice!

674
30:56.359 --> 30:56.880
Wait...

675
30:56.880 --> 30:58.319
What's with this guy's leg?

676
30:59.480 --> 31:00.359
What happened to his leg?

677
31:01.000 --> 31:01.759
Well, he...

678
31:05.240 --> 31:05.680
Buddy,

679
31:05.720 --> 31:07.039
what happened to your leg?

680
31:14.160 --> 31:14.759
Well, see...

681
31:15.000 --> 31:15.720
Back when...

682
31:16.680 --> 31:17.640
I did martial arts when I was young,

683
31:19.599 --> 31:20.480
loved doing flips,

684
31:21.079 --> 31:21.720
and busted it up.

685
31:22.839 --> 31:23.559
Doesn't slow me down, though.

686
31:23.960 --> 31:24.640
Not in the slightest.

687
31:25.000 --> 31:25.480
I'm telling you,

688
31:25.480 --> 31:26.359
if I pay attention,

689
31:26.359 --> 31:27.160
you can't even tell.

690
31:27.799 --> 31:28.680
I'm super agile.

691
31:36.599 --> 31:37.519
No issue at all.

692
31:37.599 --> 31:38.200
Are you all right?

693
31:38.240 --> 31:38.599
I'm fine.

694
31:40.200 --> 31:40.839
Let me take this call.

695
31:41.480 --> 31:42.000
What's with you?

696
31:42.000 --> 31:42.759
Have another one!

697
31:42.880 --> 31:43.799
What are you doing?

698
31:58.920 --> 32:01.039
The factory anthem sounded amazing today!

699
32:01.559 --> 32:02.599
Haven't heard it in ages.

700
32:02.920 --> 32:04.880
I got so moved, I almost cried.

701
32:05.119 --> 32:06.000
What was so good about it?

702
32:06.519 --> 32:07.160
I even forgot the lyrics.

703
32:07.880 --> 32:08.960
You sang it so well!

704
32:09.000 --> 32:10.200
Look at that high note at the end!

705
32:11.960 --> 32:13.119
Your breath was so steady.

706
32:13.119 --> 32:14.000
Really packed a punch!

707
32:14.240 --> 32:15.400
High note? Come on.

708
32:15.400 --> 32:16.400
My voice even cracked.

709
32:19.680 --> 32:20.839
It's fine!

710
32:20.839 --> 32:21.759
What's the big deal?

711
32:22.039 --> 32:23.400
We got the gifts back anyway.

712
32:23.960 --> 32:24.960
I've got plenty of buddies.

713
32:24.960 --> 32:26.599
I reached out to other folks too.

714
32:26.960 --> 32:28.079
I'll meet up with them in a few days.

715
32:28.160 --> 32:28.880
We'll give it another shot.

716
32:28.880 --> 32:29.240
Not going.

717
32:29.519 --> 32:30.000
It's humiliating.

718
32:31.400 --> 32:32.400
Why not go?

719
32:32.400 --> 32:33.799
I chatted with them for a long time.

720
32:34.279 --> 32:35.160
How long did you chat?

721
32:35.960 --> 32:36.839
All night long?

722
32:37.759 --> 32:38.599
How much money did you make?

723
32:43.640 --> 32:44.759
Did you do the full package?

724
32:45.119 --> 32:45.960
Didn't take a dime.

725
32:46.039 --> 32:46.640
It was on the house.

726
32:47.359 --> 32:47.960
How about that?

727
32:48.039 --> 32:49.039
Ain't I good to you?

728
32:50.400 --> 32:50.880
Fine.

729
32:54.559 --> 32:55.440
Listen...

730
32:56.559 --> 32:58.519
From now on, for a cripple like me,

731
32:59.279 --> 33:00.680
don't do those promotional stunts.

732
33:03.119 --> 33:04.079
I'm a lost cause anyway.

733
33:04.680 --> 33:06.880
In a few days, I'll find a watchman gig.

734
33:08.519 --> 33:09.119
Won't struggle anymore.

735
33:11.319 --> 33:12.119
Qian Yichuan!

736
33:15.920 --> 33:17.160
I look down on you.

737
33:18.359 --> 33:19.680
Then stay forever in that abandoned plant,

738
33:19.680 --> 33:20.759
guarding that crappy gate!

739
33:20.759 --> 33:21.799
I want to guard the gate!

740
33:22.599 --> 33:23.799
I love guarding the gate!

741
33:24.279 --> 33:25.680
I was born to guard gates!

742
33:25.880 --> 33:26.599
What of it?

743
33:36.319 --> 33:36.839
Fine.

744
33:37.960 --> 33:39.000
You're yelling at me now, huh?

745
33:40.319 --> 33:42.480
I don't feel sorry for you one bit now.

746
33:47.039 --> 33:48.759
I was so stupid when I was young.

747
33:50.039 --> 33:51.000
The first time I saw you,

748
33:51.000 --> 33:52.400
I thought you had real backbone,

749
33:53.039 --> 33:54.359
that you'd make something of yourself.

750
33:55.279 --> 33:56.799
How did you become such a pathetic loser?

751
33:58.680 --> 33:59.359
If this place didn't work out,

752
33:59.359 --> 34:00.799
can't you just try somewhere else?

753
34:02.279 --> 34:03.519
What are you putting on an act for?

754
34:04.960 --> 34:06.359
If you don't wanna live properly,

755
34:07.000 --> 34:08.199
go ahead and die already!

756
34:08.280 --> 34:09.599
Go die in place of good people!

757
34:14.800 --> 34:16.480
Total waste buying you these clothes!

758
34:16.679 --> 34:17.480
Waste of my money!

759
34:25.639 --> 34:26.159
Tu Chunyan!

760
34:26.880 --> 34:27.519
Tu Chunyan!

761
34:27.840 --> 34:28.599
What?!

762
35:08.559 --> 35:09.719
I haven't even taken off the tag.

763
35:12.639 --> 35:13.239
Take it back.

764
35:15.119 --> 35:15.880
Get lost.

765
35:24.559 --> 35:25.400
Get the hell out.

766
35:27.079 --> 35:27.920
Scram.

767
36:11.840 --> 36:13.159
Do you know that feeling?

768
36:14.519 --> 36:16.239
Like when I swallowed that list back then.

769
36:17.400 --> 36:18.519
Couldn't swallow it down,

770
36:18.880 --> 36:20.000
couldn't spit it out,

771
36:20.280 --> 36:20.920
just choking on it.

772
36:22.360 --> 36:23.639
I'm just an idiot.

773
36:28.519 --> 36:29.960
Actually, Cao Jun is a good guy.

774
36:32.079 --> 36:32.960
In all these years,

775
36:34.039 --> 36:35.639
it was my first time going to his place.

776
36:37.280 --> 36:39.199
If Old Qian hadn't pissed me off so badly,

777
36:40.599 --> 36:42.000
I wouldn't have gone over to chat.

778
36:44.320 --> 36:45.400
If I hadn't gone to his place,

779
36:47.199 --> 36:48.639
I wouldn't have become a suspect.

780
37:07.280 --> 37:09.000
Life is just so hard.

781
37:09.880 --> 37:11.119
Why does it have to be so exhausting?

782
37:14.719 --> 37:15.920
So many people got laid off.

783
37:17.440 --> 37:18.320
Some people,

784
37:19.400 --> 37:20.679
do whatever they can,

785
37:21.079 --> 37:22.480
just trying to survive.

786
37:25.599 --> 37:27.280
But why is Qian Yichuan like that?

787
37:29.440 --> 37:30.840
Wasting his days just waiting to die,

788
37:31.400 --> 37:32.800
always dwelling on the past,

789
37:32.800 --> 37:33.639
unable to move on.

790
37:35.440 --> 37:36.599
No matter what, I can't pull him out.

791
37:39.039 --> 37:40.519
Compared to how he used to be,

792
37:41.840 --> 37:42.800
Old Qian has changed so much.

793
38:33.480 --> 38:34.360
Look what time it is.

794
38:34.360 --> 38:36.199
You're still in the mood for needlework?

795
38:38.480 --> 38:39.079
Where are they?

796
38:40.559 --> 38:41.320
Go inside and take a seat first.

797
38:56.559 --> 38:57.239
Yan'er!

798
39:02.519 --> 39:03.000
You're here.

799
39:04.039 --> 39:05.239
Come on, have a seat inside.

800
39:05.599 --> 39:05.960
Okay.

801
39:28.519 --> 39:28.960
Chunyan.

802
39:29.440 --> 39:30.480
Go back, go sit over there.

803
39:30.880 --> 39:31.920
I like sitting next to you.

804
39:32.000 --> 39:32.480
Got a problem?

805
39:39.360 --> 39:39.880
Oh, boy.

806
39:40.960 --> 39:41.639
Sorry I'm late!

807
39:42.280 --> 39:42.800
Haipeng!

808
39:43.559 --> 39:44.280
Just waiting on me?

809
39:44.440 --> 39:45.199
There's someone else.

810
39:46.760 --> 39:47.320
Who?

811
39:47.960 --> 39:49.000
Isn't Tieping outside?

812
39:52.280 --> 39:53.039
Why are you sitting here?

813
39:53.760 --> 39:54.840
None of your business where I sit.

814
39:54.840 --> 39:55.840
Just sit down already.

815
39:57.639 --> 39:58.320
Drink up.

816
40:01.599 --> 40:02.400
Hello, Master Liu.

817
40:02.599 --> 40:03.440
Hello, hello.

818
40:15.199 --> 40:16.239
Master, everyone is here.

819
40:17.400 --> 40:18.400
Hello, everyone. Hello.

820
40:18.599 --> 40:19.320
Chief Engineer Chen.

821
40:19.360 --> 40:20.119
Chief Engineer Chen! Haipeng!

822
40:20.639 --> 40:21.440
What brings you here?

823
40:22.199 --> 40:22.840
Chief Engineer Chen.

824
40:23.760 --> 40:24.280
Take the seat of honor.

825
40:26.119 --> 40:27.079
It's Chief Engineer Chen's dinner.

826
40:28.559 --> 40:29.000
Please sit.

827
40:33.119 --> 40:33.719
Where are you sitting?

828
40:33.880 --> 40:34.440
Right here.

829
40:35.280 --> 40:36.159
Thank you. Thank you.

830
40:36.519 --> 40:38.639
It's been years since I retired.

831
40:39.079 --> 40:39.760
And I haven't...

832
40:40.079 --> 40:41.039
really gotten out

833
40:42.519 --> 40:43.119
to socialize much.

834
40:43.760 --> 40:44.400
Well...

835
40:44.800 --> 40:46.719
with two murder cases

836
40:48.480 --> 40:49.440
happening lately,

837
40:49.679 --> 40:51.079
I figured if not for this,

838
40:51.639 --> 40:52.519
us old buddies

839
40:52.719 --> 40:54.199
would rarely get together.

840
40:55.519 --> 40:55.920
Come on.

841
40:56.880 --> 40:57.599
Let me propose a toast.

842
40:57.679 --> 40:58.199
Cheers!

843
40:58.239 --> 40:59.079
Chief Engineer Chen always treats us.

844
40:59.079 --> 41:00.039
You're a rare guest.

845
41:00.480 --> 41:01.519
We actually meet up all the time.

846
41:02.039 --> 41:02.440
That's right.

847
41:03.280 --> 41:04.800
Haipeng foots the bill every time.

848
41:05.039 --> 41:05.679
Super generous.

849
41:06.079 --> 41:06.880
Least I could do.

850
41:07.440 --> 41:08.239
Haipeng's doing well.

851
41:08.440 --> 41:09.519
With that wedding business,

852
41:09.800 --> 41:10.639
he makes good money.

853
41:11.119 --> 41:12.239
Always showing off, though.

854
41:12.480 --> 41:13.960
Quit your blabbering.

855
41:14.320 --> 41:15.199
All right, all right.

856
41:17.440 --> 41:18.119
Chief Engineer Chen,

857
41:18.639 --> 41:19.239
you propose one.

858
41:19.480 --> 41:20.159
Right, you propose a toast.

859
41:22.760 --> 41:23.159
Come on.

860
41:23.920 --> 41:24.280
To Cao Jun.

861
41:24.280 --> 41:24.719
Well...

862
41:30.960 --> 41:31.280
Right.

863
41:41.119 --> 41:41.639
Hey,

864
41:45.079 --> 41:46.840
look what they're saying on TV.

865
41:47.400 --> 41:49.599
In Cao Jun and Ma Guowen's...

866
41:49.679 --> 41:50.679
in this case,

867
41:51.079 --> 41:53.199
both of them died the exact same way.

868
41:54.039 --> 41:55.800
Plastic bags over their heads,

869
41:56.119 --> 41:58.480
and beer bottle caps on their bodies.

870
41:59.880 --> 42:00.639
The way I see it,

871
42:00.920 --> 42:02.880
it was definitely the same person.

872
42:03.679 --> 42:05.400
It's a serial murder case.

873
42:06.480 --> 42:07.440
We just don't know

874
42:07.880 --> 42:09.519
who the next one is.

875
42:11.639 --> 42:12.239
Yeah.

876
42:13.360 --> 42:15.079
They both had beer bottle caps.

877
42:16.039 --> 42:16.760
Back then,

878
42:17.280 --> 42:18.880
when Liu Xuemei died,

879
42:19.840 --> 42:21.480
there was a beer bottle cap next to her.

880
42:23.039 --> 42:24.239
When Xuemei died,

881
42:24.239 --> 42:25.440
why was there a beer bottle cap?

882
42:27.320 --> 42:28.320
How should I know?

883
42:28.639 --> 42:30.440
I just saw a glimpse of it on the news,

884
42:30.440 --> 42:31.320
and it stuck with me.

885
42:32.000 --> 42:33.199
Ma Guowen got what he deserved.

886
42:34.679 --> 42:35.519
Liu Xuemei...

887
42:36.039 --> 42:36.880
she had it coming too.

888
42:37.440 --> 42:38.480
What are you saying?

889
42:38.679 --> 42:39.239
What?

890
42:39.519 --> 42:40.639
If not for her,

891
42:41.199 --> 42:42.840
would we have ended up like this?

892
42:44.239 --> 42:45.840
You ruined your own life, who's to blame?

893
42:46.199 --> 42:46.880
Blame who?

894
42:48.079 --> 42:48.519
Right.

895
42:48.800 --> 42:49.639
I can't blame anyone.

896
42:49.679 --> 42:50.559
What about Cao Jun?

897
42:52.039 --> 42:53.360
What about Cao Jun?

898
42:53.519 --> 42:54.880
Who did he ever cross?

899
42:55.559 --> 42:56.800
Cautious his entire life,

900
42:56.800 --> 42:58.000
scared of his own shadow.

901
42:58.840 --> 43:00.440
He drove a forklift just fine,

902
43:00.519 --> 43:01.519
then sold tea eggs,

903
43:01.679 --> 43:03.440
and then drove a tuk-tuk.

904
43:04.400 --> 43:05.679
Now someone's gone and killed him.

905
43:06.440 --> 43:07.320
And for what?

906
43:08.559 --> 43:09.840
Isn't it all because of that whore?

907
43:10.239 --> 43:11.159
That's enough!

908
43:11.719 --> 43:12.400
Qian Yichuan!

909
43:12.559 --> 43:13.280
She's already dead.

910
43:13.280 --> 43:14.320
Have some decency!

911
43:14.559 --> 43:15.400
Can't talk about the dead?

912
43:15.400 --> 43:16.519
Drink up, let's talk about the living.

913
43:17.280 --> 43:17.760
What do you mean?

914
43:18.239 --> 43:19.840
What's the deal with your ex-wife?

915
43:20.079 --> 43:21.119
Why did she come back?

916
43:21.119 --> 43:22.559
To make a film for Ma Guowen?

917
43:22.840 --> 43:23.960
Is she on your side,

918
43:23.960 --> 43:25.239
or is she with Ma Guowen?

919
43:25.400 --> 43:26.079
Back then... You just never quit, do you?

920
43:26.079 --> 43:27.519
Was she one of the people who betrayed us?

921
43:32.880 --> 43:33.199
Don't move.

922
43:33.239 --> 43:33.480
Me?

923
43:33.480 --> 43:34.000
Qian Yichuan.

924
43:34.559 --> 43:35.119
Let go!

925
43:35.320 --> 43:36.199
If you've got the balls,

926
43:36.360 --> 43:37.199
hit me right here.

927
43:37.599 --> 43:38.360
If beating me to death

928
43:38.360 --> 43:39.159
satisfies you,

929
43:39.320 --> 43:39.920
then go ahead and hit me!

930
43:46.880 --> 43:47.599
Where are you going?

931
43:48.079 --> 43:49.039
I'm talking to you!

932
43:49.920 --> 43:50.639
Don't move!

933
43:50.920 --> 43:53.199
I just want to know how she really died.

934
43:53.239 --> 43:54.760
What happened to her before she died?

935
43:55.400 --> 43:56.199
She froze to death.

936
43:57.480 --> 43:59.079
Why can't you just let this go?
